{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29167","headline":"舟行早发庐陵郡郭寄滕郎中 · 许浑","name":"舟行早发庐陵郡郭寄滕郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚客停桡太守知，露凝丹叶自秋悲。\n蟹螯只恐相如渴，鲈鱠应防曼倩饥。\n风卷曙云飘角远，雨昏寒浪挂帆迟。\n离心更羡高斋夕，巫峡花深醉玉巵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}